Uses the gh CLI (keyring auth). If the GH_TOKEN env var is present but
invalid it is dropped for gh calls so it can't shadow the keyring login.
Idempotent: skips milestones/issues whose titles already exist.

Run:  python3 create_issues_july6.py
"""
